WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.003 --> 00:00:04.763
"I'm sorry!" Rapunzel said.

2
00:00:04.764 --> 00:00:10.393
The witch was furious. "You are so careless!

3
00:00:10.394 --> 00:00:13.470
Now we must start all over again.

4
00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:19.541
We'll be late for the market!"

5
00:00:19.542 --> 00:00:27.853
Rapunzel began to clean up the mess.

6
00:00:27.854 --> 00:00:31.524
She wiped up the potion on the table.

7
00:00:31.525 --> 00:00:36.543
She mopped up the puddles on the floor.

8
00:00:36.544 --> 00:00:42.413
"Ugh," she said. "I'm a mess too!"

9
00:00:42.414 --> 00:00:46.053
Potion dripped from her clothes.

10
00:00:46.054 --> 00:00:50.804
It dripped from her braid.

11
00:00:50.805 --> 00:00:56.992
Rapunzel cleaned herself up.

12
00:00:56.993 --> 00:01:01.462
Then she mixed more hair potion.

13
00:01:01.463 --> 00:01:04.992
"Leave that here," the witch snapped.

14
00:01:04.993 --> 00:01:08.203
"The king's servant will come for it later.

15
00:01:08.204 --> 00:01:11.402
Put the other potions in my basket.

16
00:01:11.403 --> 00:01:18.182
Hurry! We have to go to the market now!"

17
00:01:18.183 --> 00:01:21.691
Soon they left for the market.

18
00:01:21.692 --> 00:01:26.824
They walked slowly along the road.

19
00:01:26.825 --> 00:01:31.055
Suddenly the witch stopped.

20
00:01:31.056 --> 00:01:34.409
She stared at Rapunzel.

21
00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:37.168
"Oh no!" Rapunzel thought.

22
00:01:37.169 --> 00:01:40.526
Prickle was moving in her pocket.

23
00:01:40.527 --> 00:01:45.282
Could the witch see him and the magic book?

24
00:01:45.283 --> 00:01:50.501
"What did you do to your hair?" the witch snapped.

25
00:01:50.502 --> 00:01:56.477
"My hair?" Rapunzel said. "Nothing. Why?"

26
00:01:56.478 --> 00:01:59.583
Rapunzel touched her braid.

27
00:01:59.584 --> 00:02:03.278
It was still wet.

28
00:02:03.279 --> 00:02:06.011
"Hmm," she thought.

29
00:02:06.012 --> 00:02:09.526
It also felt longer.

30
00:02:09.527 --> 00:02:13.716
Rapunzel looked down and gasped.

31
00:02:13.717 --> 00:02:18.309
Her hair was growing to her knees!

32
00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:22.102
"You silly goose!" the witch cried.

33
00:02:22.103 --> 00:02:25.776
"You spilled hair potion on your hair!"

34
00:02:25.777 --> 00:02:29.134
Rapunzel's hair kept growing.

35
00:02:29.135 --> 00:02:33.334
Soon her braid touched the ground.

36
00:02:33.335 --> 00:02:38.776
"My hair is so long!" Rapunzel moaned.

37
00:02:38.777 --> 00:02:41.053
"Can you cut it?"

38
00:02:41.054 --> 00:02:46.218
The witch shook her head. "I didn't bring scissors.

39
00:02:46.219 --> 00:02:51.877
You'll have to wait."

40
00:02:51.878 --> 00:02:57.210
At the market Rapunzel set out the potions for sale.

41
00:02:57.211 --> 00:02:59.960
A boy came over.

42
00:02:59.961 --> 00:03:04.042
"What happened to your hair?" he asked.

43
00:03:04.043 --> 00:03:08.380
Rapunzel looked down, about to cry.

44
00:03:08.381 --> 00:03:12.099
Her head felt so heavy.

45
00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:15.099
And when she looked up again . . .

46
00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:19.189
Everyone was staring at her!

